    "sections": {
        "description": "The Aster Bike Rental Theme is a specialised, SEO-friendly, and responsive template for bike rental businesses, offering a user-friendly platform to promote bike hire services efficiently. Ideal for mountain bike rentals, city bike rentals, tandem bike rentals, electric bike rentals, cargo bike rentals, folding bike rentals, student bike rental packages, and eco-friendly bike rentals, it supports bike rental with GPS, hourly bike rental services, long-term bike rental deals, daily bike rental rates, weekly bike rental plans, seasonal bike rental promotions, and custom bike rental options. Perfect for tourists, locals, and adventure seekers, it is also suited for corporate events, scenic tours, family outings, and group bike rentals with accessories or child seats. Its clean, modern design ensures smooth navigation across devices, while built-in sections highlight services, pricing tables, and bike rental offers. Features like review sections, customer feedback, and image galleries build trust and credibility. Integration with the Bookly plugin streamlines bike rental bookings, online reservations, and payment management, making operations hassle-free. Whether offering affordable bike rental solutions, weekend bike rental packages, or electric bike rental deals, the Aster Bike Rental theme helps businesses attract more customers, boost visibility, and accelerate growth in the competitive bike rental industry while ensuring a seamless digital experience."
    },
